983
00:54:43,440 --> 00:54:46,120
I think it would be without equal,

984
00:54:46,120 --> 00:54:49,120
a dreamlike place of modernity.

985
00:54:49,480 --> 00:54:53,560
Sometimes I think this season in
particular pulls that off extremely well,

986
00:54:53,960 --> 00:54:56,880
where you sense it could
perhaps still turn out differently.

987
00:54:56,880 --> 00:54:59,920
I hope we carry that hope inside us,
so that people say:

988
00:54:59,920 --> 00:55:03,040
let's do it differently this time
than we did back then.

989
00:56:25,060 --> 00:56:30,800
subs by Kya Bamba
